+// ============================================================
+// G2 batch 1: *mut expr-spine transcriptions (HIGH-confidence only).
+// Insert immediately BEFORE `fn checker_check_expr_inplace` (~line 2497).
+// Each is a faithful *mut transcription of the matching by-value check_*
+// handler; children recurse through the *mut spine
+// (checker_check_opt_expr_inplace / checker_check_expr_inplace /
+// checker_check_block_inplace), keeping every frame KB-scale and off the
+// by-value 12MB path. State-returning by-value helpers that do NOT recurse
+// into check_expr are bridged by-value-ONCE via checker_store_from_value
+// (the proven pattern at checker_check_binding_init_expr_bridge:2674-2678).
+// Dispatch on enum-kind uses if-chains, NOT `match <enum-field>` (bin/souc
+// miscompiles that in *mut fns — root-caused in 0afad182c); `match <Option>`
